Index: `docs/README.md`. New agent: `docs/llm-onboarding.md` + `docs/developing.md`. Dedicated pass: skill `goko-local-docs`. Project-wide agent instructions also live in the repository root `AGENTS.md` and apply to every chat/agent working in GokoWeb.

## Test-layer choice

- Vitest covers pure logic, parsers, money/date rules, permissions, API routes, error contracts, retries, idempotency, and disposable-database workflows.
- Playwright covers critical navigation and cross-component journeys, responsive behavior, and user-visible loading/empty/unauthorized states with deterministic mocked APIs.
- Reuse existing helpers and suites; add shared fixtures only when multiple tests need the same setup.

If you change a landmine (array wire format, permission mismatch, occupancy split, `useAdminApi` target), update `docs/llm-onboarding.md`.
